    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "drifting doesn't feel like peace, it just feels like waiting to die. everything feels so heavy and so meaningless. it's like i'm stuck in this halfway place, between being alive and being nothing. it would be so much easier to just... not have to fight the static anymore. to just be still. does it ever stop feeling like this? or is this just what's left?",
